||Due in 1dHackathon Universitária Superteam BrasilSuperteam Brasil3,000USDG||Due in 1dCastleDAO Content ChallengeSuperteam Ireland1,000USDG||Due in 2dAbout Aeonian TradeAeonian Trade is a social perpetual trading platform. We make perpetual trading more interactive by combining trading tools with a social experience where traders can discover each other, share ideas, follow activity, and build their presence within the trading community.With trader profiles, social interactions, rewards, referrals, and upcoming Livestreams, Aeonian is building more than just a trading interface. We're building a social layer around perpetual trading.Website: https://aeonian.tradeMissionCreate an X (Twitter) thread that explains Aeonian Trade, introduces its social perpetual trading experience, and gets readers excited about the upcoming Livestreams feature.Scope DetailExplain what Aeonian Trade is in a clear and engaging way.Explain how users can trade Solana perpetuals on Aeonian and who the platform is built for.Highlight Aeonian's social trading experience, including trader profiles, following other traders, posts, status updates, likes, and replies. Show how these features help users discover traders, share trading ideas, discuss the market, and build their presence within the community.Explain Aeonian's Rewards & Referral System, including how users can earn rewards through participation and benefit from inviting others to the platform.Introduce the upcoming Livestreams feature. Explain how traders will be able to share their trading sessions, interact with viewers, and connect with the community in real time.Mention that Aeonian Livestreams are launching soon.Share your own perspective or creative angle on why social features and Livestreams can make perpetual trading more engaging, interactive, and community-driven.Include a clear call-to-action encouraging readers to visit Aeonian and follow @Aeonian_Trade for updates.Website link: https://aeonian.tradeX: @Aeonian_TradeVideo: Highly RecommendedWe strongly recommend including a short video with your thread.Video ideas include:Screen recording of Aeonian TradeTrading interface walkthroughTrader profile demonstrationSocial features demonstrationRewards or referral system walkthroughLivestream teaser or creative conceptYour own trading session or commentaryVideo submissions are not mandatory, but high-quality videos may be considered favorably during judging.Submission RequirementsThe submission must be an X (Twitter) thread.The thread must contain at least 4 posts.The thread must be written in English.The thread must clearly explain Aeonian Trade and its social perpetual trading experience.The thread must mention @Aeonian_Trade.The thread must include a link to https://aeonian.trade.The thread must cover Aeonian's social features, rewards and/or referral system.The thread must introduce the upcoming Livestreams feature and mention that Livestreams are launching soon.The content must be original.Video is highly recommended but optional.Provide a link to your X thread as the submission.Judging CriteriaAccuracy & Understanding: How well the thread explains Aeonian and its features.Clarity: How easily someone unfamiliar with Aeonian can understand the platform.Creativity & Engagement: The originality, storytelling, and appeal of the thread.Content Quality: Writing, visuals, structure, and overall presentation.Engagement: How effectively the thread encourages readers to interact with the content and explore Aeonian.Video Quality: For submissions including video, the quality, creativity, and usefulness of the video will be considered.Reward Structure1st Place: 250 USDC2nd Place: 150 USDC3rd Place: 100 USDCTotal Prize Pool: 500 USDCSKILLS NEEDEDContentCONTACTReach outif you have any questions about this initialBountyWINNER ANNOUNCEMENT BYSeptember 23, 2026 - as scheduled by the sponsor.15CommentsCancelCommentRidho Alpha4h agohttps://x.com/RidhoAlphaoxp/st...
