### Tweet 1/10 🚀
DeFi yield generation is often fragmented, complex, and risky. Enter @AeonianTrade — a decentralized portfolio management & yield optimization protocol built to automate growth while maintaining full self-custody. 

Here is everything you need to know 🧵👇

---

### Tweet 2/10 💡 What is Aeonian Trade?
